        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 17-3/4 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Traditional styled 17-3/4\" Oil Rubbed Bronze door pull is packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panels and doors up to 1-3/4\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-810S-details.jpg?v=1704442286\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pull\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis door handle is assembled and finished in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for high quality innovational door pull designs.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions CF810S-18-US10B:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Thru-Bolted Mounting (Pull bolts through the door).</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 17-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mounting: 16\" c. c.</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Rosette Diameter: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 3/4\" to 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Oil Rubbed Bronze</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>*Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n** Item Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/first-impressions-door-pulls\">First Impressions Door Pulls</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
